  "findings": [
    "Six repair and six original fresh native close/wide frames personally viewed; four corrected fresh frames reviewed before first score. Lac Sec F02 rejected as wrong feature identity.",
    "Ten actual old/new warp panels: Grand north lobe locally improves but shape remains wrong, Shaw moves south and shears, Rocky Islets move away from modern geometry, Thorn/Glasgow and Janvrin coves remain offset.",
